    "description": "The opening frame shows only 'Good morning.' near centre. The whole home layout then glides upward and slightly shrinks together while the prompt input, suggestion chips and meetings list fade in beneath the greeting, so the greeting settles into its place as the page header.",
    "why_premium": "The product opens on a single human line and the UI builds around it in one continuous, eased move, with no cut or pop. The greeting becomes the anchor of the real interface, and the soft fade-and-rise reads calm and native to the product."
  },
